Subject: [PATCH 11/12] adapt: the one-GPU series' Flash Next sources back
 under 600 lines

cuda_batch.zig and cuda_prompt.zig each sat at the limit on main. argmax moves to cuda_argmax.zig (as the FP8
recipe's 0081 does), Engine.keptOn moves to cuda_snap.keptOn, the fused router's fallback moves into
cuda_route_fused.route, and the split-or-fused GDN choice into cuda_gdn_fused.launchForm. Same launches.
